<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 898 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 898 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 898 million pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday through a combination of three direct sales of paper and two repurchase agreements, dealers said.</p>
<p>The Cetes sales were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    150 million    337 days</p>
<p>    150 million    176 days</p>
<p>    150 million     85 days</p>
<p>The amounts and maturities of the repurchase agreements were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    300 million     22 days</p>
<p>    148 million	1 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
